 value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"GameRun\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" run1 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" SpeedRun(\" /><text value=\"1200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" run2 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ArcadeRun(\" /><text value=\"300\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"run1.start();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"run2.start();\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>extends</code>, następnie <code>GameRun</code>, a potem <code>run2</code>, <code>.</code>, <code>start</code>, <code>(</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>"
